swap per order</h3>\n      <p class=\"perk-description\">We cover shipping out, you cover shipping back.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"perk-row\">\n    <div class=\"perk-icon perk-icon--badge perk-icon--full-svg\">\n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"30-day window return\">\n        <circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#EEDBC9\"/>\n        <g transform=\"translate(8,8) scale(1.5)\">\n          <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7C3A26\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/>\n            <path d=\"M8 3v4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M15 3v4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M3 10h16\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"11\" y=\"18.3\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#7C3A26\">30</text>\n          <circle cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7C3A26\"/>\n          <g transform=\"translate(15.32,15.72) scale(0.35)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EEDBC9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 13-6.2\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n            <path d=\"M20 5v5h-5\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n          </g>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"perk-content\">\n      <h3 class=\"perk-title\">30-Day Window Returns</h3>\n      <p class=\"perk-description\">\n        Try them on, risk-free. If they don't work out, return within 30 days (unworn condition). See our full <a href=\"/pages/returns-policy\">policy</a> for details.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .custom-perks-wrapper {\n    background-color: #fdf6f2; \n    padding: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 24px;\n    max-width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .perk-row {\n    display: flex;\n    al