      "settings": {
        "replo_text_67172fea-8e65-45b8-9070-fad9e61504cc": "<p>Confidence that doesn’t slip</p>",
        "replo_text_bd8337bb-0b04-408a-9980-24206a6539aa": "<p>Wear in all Bra Pockets </p>",
        "replo_text_6cb97976-cb70-46d6-b4d8-b4fe56e76076": "<p>Blends with Your Skin</p>",
        "replo_text_32368589-a1bb-4728-a1a6-42c9a2c990fc": "<p>Swim, Sweat, Repeat</p>",
        "replo_text_15c981c9-93d6-4fc6-9eb0-84a1a638ca90": "<p>Washable & Reusable</p>",
        "replo_text_c81510a6-9724-4689-9de8-e9f2977368f1": "<p>Tested on Real Bodies</p>"
      }
    },
    "replo_replo_testimonials_bcd9M7": {
      "type": "replo-replo-testimonials",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Replo testimonials",
      "settings": {
        "replo_text_8284a0de-19b4-43ce-a081-c1d346204c6b": "<p>Loved by <strong>100,000+</strong> Happy Customers</p>",
        "replo_text_c2cb336d-d852-4996-9c93-1444b73f427d": "<p>Finally. They stay put.</p>",
        "replo_text_f781ea54-6b12-4ed9-82dc-a25b8c0e0247": "<p>My sister recommended these stay-put bra inserts, and I’m so glad I tried them! I choose the Triangle Plus for extra shaping: they’re thick, natural-looking, and exactly what I wanted.</p>",
        "replo_text_1924ef89-dc98-4e1b-bf0b-a1c5f689860b": "<p>Mandy G</p>",
        "replo_text_2144ed75-914d-4d6b-8543-66053e249cca": "<p>Daughter-Recommended</p>",
        "replo_text_a3d3b79c-3733-4765-a215-57bbc5a554d3": "<p>Wasn’t sure I’d like the style, but once I tried it on, I was amazed. The support and lift made me feel great in my swimsuit: something I hadn’t felt in years!</p>",
        "replo_text_8afcb759-5108-4063-84f6-029ccbf917f5": "<p>Marjorie S</p>",
        "replo_text_df796fea-1828-4545-a393-98a67471243c": "<p>Perfect Boost for Swimwear</p>",
        "replo_text_a341fe07-6ca8-4866-a11e-1e2e8a231745": "<p>I have some sagging and wanted to feel confident in my swimsuit. Took a chance on these: so glad I did! Wore them in the pockets and they stayed put all week on vacation.</p>",
        "replo_text_5afc2acd-2075-4fc1-9b7d-ce746b5647e1": "<p>Camilla R</p>",
        "replo_text_74abe7b4-ce62-4760-91b2-81cb429ac4f1": "<p>Invisible Support on My Big Day</p>",
        "replo_text_2da0cf8a-50b3-4044-8645-fa997ddd6a47": "<p>Wore these in my wedding dress for subtle shaping and coverage. No tape or stick-ons: just soft, invisible support. They looked and felt amazing!</p>",
        "replo_text_3792c914-199f-4e2d-8e4e-c1de736c4fa8": "<p>Susan D</p>",
        "replo_text_fb5f6fe4-a5e1-4a0b-9367-64ff98905cf1": "<p>Natural Lift for Mature Busts</p>",
        "replo_text_c211e800-4d9d-434c-9625-03292c50276a": "<p>Weight loss and aging left me feeling insecure about sagging. These inserts made a huge difference: lifted, fuller, and natural. I finally feel good in fitted clothes again!</p>",
        "replo_text_764cf48c-baf9-4b00-a0fe-84b0b0a4aec8": "<p>Sandie F</p>",
        "replo_text_8d98db58-b886-4bb2-b7b4-ee80ed50020f": "<p>Surprisingly Supportive</p>",
        "replo_text_004b843d-19e0-4f1b-ae31-e676bd983b98": "<p>I like these much more than I thought I would. My breasts look more lifted and feel supported.  I've worn them in a wireless style bra and a swimsuit. Both were great.</p>",
        "replo_text_be25b422-5625-4e96-bab4-ef17b55e2c68": "<p>Luciana M</p>",
        "replo_text_e78a70d5-a38c-4bf9-b231-6354b6f9fd1f": "<p>Perfect for Hot Days!</p>",
        "replo_text_55d4ffbe-6350-4719-8d6f-06ba251081ea": "<p>Tried them with my fitted bandeau top: stayed in place all day while walking and shopping. Gave just the right coverage and shaping without needing a bra!</p>",
        "replo_text_4f4087b4-17b3-4f6f-90e8-6af6de5879b0": "<p>Tracey I</p>",
        "replo_text_1195b857-be93-45a2-86c0-ec61d8806d4e": "<p>Feather-Light & Flattering</p>",
        "replo_text_dcfaf4b2-9689-4f41-853b-84e92c91eae1": "<p>So light! Coverage is plenty and they are as light as a feather. Love that! I have a larger bust and appreciate no extra padding. These are great!</p>",
        "replo_text_ff07f76e-9d2d-4c14-8ec9-776ae62d9a39": "<p>Carla K</p>",
        "replo_text_2e49baa0-213a-46e5-83d6-c625901e296c": "<p>Finally. They stay put.</p>",
        "replo_text_e20636e5-1dea-4553-ba17-03294fd43ff7": "<p>My sister recommended these stay-put bra inserts, and I’m so glad I tried them! I choose the Triangle Plus for extra shaping: they’re thick, natural-looking, and exactly what I wanted.</p>",
        "replo_text_664b287d-c740-45e0-97ba-c7d312818097": "<p>Mandy G</p>",
        "replo_text_298df878-90d9-4127-bcf9-5520290d3fe7": "<p>Daughter-Recommended</p>",
        "replo_text_e21f0d3a-e89b-4ff3-b547-9aa1a0bd3b5a": "<p>Wasn’t sure I’d like the style, but once I tried it on, I was amazed. The support and lift made me feel great in my swimsuit: something I hadn’t felt in years!</p>",
        "replo_text_14da6033-2695-40ff-b4c9-dd9c7235d5d0": "<p>Marjorie S</p>",
        "replo_text_3ebcddb3-5579-484c-9e47-c1f4d11983d9": "<p>Perfect Boost for Swimwear</p>",
        "replo_text_c118bc80-6f6c-48d1-8938-278525306a8c": "<p>I have some sagging and wanted to feel confident in my swimsuit. Took a chance on these: so glad I did! Wore them in the pockets and they stayed put all week on vacation.</p>",
        "replo_text_2a338e3e-b199-47b4-8923-7b8d9cc7ebaf": "<p>Camilla R</p>",
        "replo_text_60b4eeab-ff56-406e-b8a3-b73d42d99979": "<p>Invisible Support on My Big Day</p>",
        "replo_text_0cfd0eb6-d6b4-443f-864c-0f34bbff6dd4": "<p>Wore these in my wedding dress for subtle shaping and coverage. No tape or stick-ons: just soft, invisible support. They looked and felt amazing!</p>",
        "replo_text_80ca3dc0-4167-47d3-b4b0-9de8e707f868": "<p>Susan D</p>",
        "replo_text_ee654086-c191-4c5e-a88b-d3f2eebb4b6a": "<p>Natural Lift for Mature Busts</p>",
        "replo_text_5c95be53-dd5e-4fea-8f9f-cf8f54dd9674": "<p>Weight loss and aging left me feeling insecure about sagging. These inserts made a huge difference: lifted, fuller, and natural. I finally feel good in fitted clothes again!</p>",
        "replo_text_f8091c7d-e547-4120-8edb-7545365a8197": "<p>Sandie F</p>",
        "replo_text_6c519807-74a1-46ed-b038-db1ce565b841": "<p>Surprisingly Supportive</p>",
        "replo_text_cdc08ef1-cebb-4c96-85be-2b7ef4dba7b1": "<p>I like these much more than I thought I would. My breasts look more lifted and feel supported.  I've worn them in a wireless style bra and a swimsuit. Both were great.</p>",
        "replo_text_da3fa0b4-8ee8-4b9b-bafa-d0b0ed69821d": "<p>Luciana M</p>",
        "replo_text_621fea90-500b-4401-a185-c4de2edbf37e": "<p>Perfect for Hot Days!</p>",
        "replo_text_5a024986-9e52-47f9-bdf4-a437193d2538": "<p>Tried them with my fitted bandeau top: stayed in place all day while walking and shopping. Gave just the right coverage and shaping without needing a bra!</p>",
        "replo_text_85488082-2579-45e3-935c-5653c3b99a0b": "<p>Tracey I</p>",
        "replo_text_37bce111-3cee-4aad-b296-253e51e54887": "<p>Feather-Light & Flattering</p>",
        "replo_text_88faba4e-09c8-4f6f-9d9d-2012124aadcc": "<p>So light! Coverage is plenty and they are as light as a feather. Love that! I have a larger bust and appreciate no extra padding. These are great!</p>",
        "replo_text_b833cfe1-17aa-4ab2-8bd2-af404ab56264": "<p>Carla K</p>",
        "replo_text_6e9d5aaf-7b9d-4995-86b7-983b16bbaf47": "<p>No Slips. Just Solutions - Shop Now</p>",
        "replo_text_b629c70c-2ec0-4cc9-8b1b-b0ca8a5dce90": "<p>Hassle-Free 30-Day Tryout</p>"
      }
    },
