    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "question-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What size should I get?",
            "row_content": "<p>Refer to our Size Guide and locate your bra size. We also list the insert dimensions if you want to double check the size of your garment, it's an excellent way to be sure it will fit properly</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will they stay in place without anything else under a shirt or dress? ",
            "row_content": "<p>No, the inserts need to be inside a swimsuit, sports bra, workout top, bralette, regular bra. They are not a strapless \"silicone bra\" that you can wear by itself.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I know if I have the right fit? ",
            "row_content": "<p>If the insert moves around<strong> the first day</strong> while you are wearing, it is too big size down. Your breasts should cup the blue side and there should not be space. If the insert seems too small on your breast, not covering enough, size up. You can also tell it is too small because an outline will show from being so pressed. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "45676c86-b287-46a4-a9d7-242083272135": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this a push-up, cleavage enhancing inserts?",
            "row_content": "<p>No this style is for shaping and nipple coverage. It does provide lift and support but is not a push-up</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1538a2d2-9b44-4dd2-8191-598f390191ba": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much support do the inserts offer?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our half moons inserts provide light support. The half moons don't provide a push up effect.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2df8f5e0-a9bb-45bd-a994-7f71b1a2cc44": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use them in a chlorine pool or at the beach in salt water? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, our inserts are made with polyester which is the best fabric for chlorine and saltwater. The medical grade silicone outside and polyester have been tested and approved in these conditions. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "e7ee94b6-439c-4e66-a0a2-cb89eda84f48": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can you really keep them in your sports bra, bralette or swimsuit in the washing machine?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes you can! The beauty about it too is they stay in your garment and don't end up at the bottom of your washer!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "a29a37c5-2a4e-4705-8da1-93d40ef1b33d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I don't see my bra size listed, will anything fit me? ",
            "row_content": "<p>We strive to include as many women as possible. Send us an email or IM message. We may be able to recommend a size to try and we will keep in mind for adding in the future! We built Honey Cloudz on feedback.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
