    "testimonials": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>These are just wonderful. I wear unlined cotton bralettes for comfort and when I go out I just slip these in for a little more coverage. I love how they look natural since they don’t add too much and they are very lightweight and breathable., no slipping out problems at all. I highly recommend.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_63.png",
            "author": "Mindy Witherspoon, Boise ID"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"I bought these for my sportsbras mainly because I was tired of fixing the dumb pads that come with them. These work as advertised! I bought 4 pairs for the sportsbras I wear the most and I leave them in all the time. I wear them, workout hard with no moving inserts and then throw them in my wash. When I take my laundry out the inserts are still in the pockets nicely! SO SO SO much easier! Thank you for this amazing product.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_69.png",
            "author": "Jenny Maxwell, Walnut Creek CA"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"I liked my suits and hated the cups that came with them. I took those babies out and replaced with cloudz. So much better! They provide a great shape, looks natural but better and the inserts are lightweight. They are not these thick hot pads thankfully. The best part of all is that they stay in my suits! I leave them in after wearing and they stay inside in the washer. They only need a slight adjustment inside the pocket after. Miracle product!\"</p>",
            "author": "Malissa Miller, Charleston South Carolina"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"I am a young 50's and was looking for something for bras. These are the perfect add. They stay in place and smooth everything. My tops look better. They make me feel like I look younger, have a nicer round shape. These are all I will buy!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_65.png",
            "author": "Daria M"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store's happy customers.</p>",
            "author": "Author's name"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
